{"id":"dore_navant","lemma":"dorénavant","pos":"adv","rank":3736,"glosses":["henceforth, from now on, from this day forward"],"ipa":"/dɔ.ʁe.na.vɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Fr-Paris--dor%C3%A9navant.ogg/Fr-Paris--dor%C3%A9navant.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je ne le ferai plus dorénavant.","en":"I won't do that from now on.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null]},{"text":"Ça fonctionnera dorénavant.","en":"It'll work now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/351689","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to function, to work","l":"fonctionner"},null]},{"text":"Étudie plus dur dorénavant.","en":"Study harder from now on.","words":[{"g":"to study","l":"étudier"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"hard, tough"},null]},{"text":"Tom est dorénavant en prison.","en":"Tom is now in jail.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"prison"}]},{"text":"Je ne pourrai plus faire affaire avec toi dorénavant.","en":"I can't deal with you anymore.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"business"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"you"},null]}]}